{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stuff your cheeks with onigiri and make friends with even more friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Me and (My) Cat's Castle X&quot;, you control a character who transforms by stuffing their cheeks with onigiri. Take on the challenge of the &quot;Cat's Castle&quot; in this platformer!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A protagonist who transforms by eating onigiri</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your interactions with onigiri and others change as you transform</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stages with even more challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 640x480 pixel world with 16x16 pixel characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A prequel to &quot;Me and (My) Cat's Island&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New mode: &quot;VERY EASY&quot; added</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New item: &quot;Umbrella&quot; added</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A prequel to &quot;Me and (My) Cat's Island&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With just a D-pad and two buttons, &quot;I&quot; can jump, shoot, and eat the onigiri I stuff my cheeks with\u2014that\u2019s it! Master different behaviors in various situations, overcome gimmicks, clear stages, and take on the mysterious castle once again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Streaming Guidelines</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game allows video streaming and monetization with no restrictions for both individuals and businesses.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1237120?t=1754794049","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237120/ebfcfa1bbd0ca162820a579376001cb7100e5b99/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754794049","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1237120/b80